        "optionC": "Dataset-level state changes and error details for the failed step, including which dataset failed and what the error was",
        "optionD": "The source system's own error logs, forwarded automatically whenever an ingestion step fails",
        "optionE": "Data quality metrics for each expectation, including how many records passed and how many were dropped or failed",
