        "optionD": "Structured, semi-structured, and unstructured respectively - the first two become Delta tables with the JSON's variability handled by schema evolution or a rescue column, while the PDFs belong in a Unity Catalog volume",
        "answer": [
            "optionD"
        ],
        "type": "single"
