        "optionC": "The deployment preserves manual changes, since a bundle updates only the attributes that appear in its configuration and leaves others untouched",
        "optionD": "The deployment creates a second copy of the job so that both the manual and configured versions are retained",
        "answer": [
            "optionA"
        ],
        "type": "single"
