        "optionD": "Exactly-once processing is achieved by combining the stream's checkpoint, which records which files were consumed, with the atomic commit of a Delta sink",
        "optionE": "Achieving exactly-once requires a unique key on the target table so that duplicate rows can be rejected on insert",
