        "optionC": "Grant SELECT on the table to all analysts and rely on Unity Catalog lineage to audit who viewed ssn, since masking cannot be applied to an existing column",
        "optionD": "Create one table per region and grant each regional group SELECT on its own table, dropping ssn from every copy except the one for pii_readers",
        "answer": [
            "optionB"
        ],
        "type": "single"
